    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d75-a12">

                <pb facs="0703" n="691" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv06/pg691"/>

                <head>Appendix X to CF–92</head>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ottoman
                            Delegation to the Peace Conference</hi>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-06-23">June 23, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">memorandum concerning the new
                        organisation of the ottoman empire</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">[<hi rendition="#italic">Note From the Turkish Delegation to
                        the President of the Peace Conference</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Clemenceau</hi>)]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Translation</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sirs</hi>: I have the honour to transmit to Your
                    Excellency herewith a memorandum concerning the new organisation of the Ottoman
                    Empire. This is the memorandum the despatch of which I announced at the meeting
                    of the Supreme Council of Peace on the 17th June.<anchor n="14" xml:id="d75-f1"
                    /></p>
                <p>The preparation of a document of this importance having necessitated lengthy
                    labour, I beg Your Excellency to excuse me for the delay in forwarding it to
                    you.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamad Ferid</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
